                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "Interesing, for me in Lua files lua_ls contains this:\r\n\r\n`triggerCharacters = { \"\\t\", \"\\n\", \".\", \":\", \"(\", \"'\", '\"', \"[\", \",\", \"#\", \"*\", \"@\", \"|\", \"=\", \"-\", \"{\", \" \", \"+\", \"?\" }`\r\n\r\nIn PHP files it was the TailwindCSS server that has a space (and lua_ls was also present despite ft = \"lua\"; then I disabled the lazydev plugin and now it is no longer active when editing PHP files).\r\n\r\nBut also with lazydev disabled I have a space in the triggerCharacters in lua_ls.\r\n\r\nCan I edit the tiggerCharacters in the server config?",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Interesing, for me in Lua files lua_ls contains this:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">triggerCharacters = { \"\\t\", \"\\n\", \".\", \":\", \"(\", \"'\", '\"', \"[\", \",\", \"#\", \"*\", \"@\", \"|\", \"=\", \"-\", \"{\", \" \", \"+\", \"?\" }</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In PHP files it was the TailwindCSS server that has a space (and lua_ls was also present despite ft = \"lua\"; then I disabled the lazydev plugin and now it is no longer active when editing PHP files).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">But also with lazydev disabled I have a space in the triggerCharacters in lua_ls.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Can I edit the tiggerCharacters in the server config?</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Interesing, for me in Lua files lua_ls contains this:\ntriggerCharacters = { \"\\t\", \"\\n\", \".\", \":\", \"(\", \"'\", '\"', \"[\", \",\", \"#\", \"*\", \"@\", \"|\", \"=\", \"-\", \"{\", \" \", \"+\", \"?\" }\nIn PHP files it was the TailwindCSS server that has a space (and lua_ls was also present despite ft = \"lua\"; then I disabled the lazydev plugin and now it is no longer active when editing PHP files).\nBut also with lazydev disabled I have a space in the triggerCharacters in lua_ls.\nCan I edit the tiggerCharacters in the server config?",
